requests.description:
STEP 2 - the full dashboard for the selected farm in ONE response: Regen Health Index, 6 category scores (0-100), upcoming/next assessment, recent activity, and summary. All REAL data from the farmer's assessments; `trendVsLastYear` and `recommendations` are null/[] (not computed yet). Scores are null until fields are assessed. Needs a FARMER token.

### Expected response (OK 200)

