**Upcoming (programs only):** `upcoming.programs` lists the future-start program schemes in the farm’s ORG - the farmer can’t enroll yet (enrollment opens on `startDate`), soonest first, each with `status: "upcoming"`. Pending field assessments are NOT here - the app reads those from `/assessments/my/fields`.

